@admin_email = {{$dotenv ADMIN_EMAIL}}
@admin_password = {{$dotenv ADMIN_PASSWORD}}

### 1.1 Login
POST http://localhost:9192/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{admin_email}}",
    "password": "{{admin_password}}",
    "rememberMe": false
}

### 1.2 Register (admin) one time for first time to create admin account
POST http://localhost:9192/admin/register-admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstname": "",
    "lastname": "",
    "email": "",
    "password": ""
}

### 1.3 Forgot Password
POST http://localhost:9192/admin/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": ""
}

### 1.3.1 Reset Password (ใช้ token จาก email)
POST http://localhost:9192/admin/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "password": "",
    "passwordConfirmation": "",
    "code": ""
}

### 1.4 Profile
GET http://localhost:9192/admin/users/me
Authorization: Bearer <admin-jwt-token>
